4. **Zero heap allocations on hot path**: Use pre-allocated buffers, stack allocation, object pools

Key components:
- Rational time representation (using int64_t for numerator/denominator)
- TimeRange structure with start/duration
- Track/Clip structures
- Gap detection and resolution algorithms
- 3D tensor view with stride permutation (zero-copy)
- Pre-allocated buffers for hot path

