This implementation covers:
1. Rational time arithmetic with normalization
2. TimeRange operations (overlap, intersection, containment)
3. Track with clips and gap detection/resolution (zero allocation on hot path via reserved buffer)
4. RationalTimeResampler for frame rate conversion
5. Zero-copy Tensor3DView with stride permutation for NumPy/Pybind11 interop
6. TimelineComposer for multi-track composition (OpenTimelineIO style)
7. Comprehensive test suite covering all edge cases

The code is self-contained, uses only standard C++17 headers, and compiles with g++ -std=c++17 -O2.

